# Ping Commands

## Test connectivity to all hosts

```bash
ansible all -m ping
```

## Test a single host

```bash
ansible web1 -m ping
```

## Test a host group

```bash
ansible webservers -m ping
```

## Ping using a custom inventory

```bash
ansible all -i inventory.ini -m ping
```

## Ping with privilege escalation

```bash
ansible all -b -m ping
```

## Ping with a specific user

```bash
ansible all -u ubuntu -m ping
```

## Ping with a private key

```bash
ansible all -m ping --private-key ~/.ssh/ansible.pem
```

## Ping and display detailed output

```bash
ansible all -m ping -vvv
```

## Ping using host limit

```bash
ansible all --limit webservers -m ping
```

## Ping excluding a host group

```bash
ansible all:!databases -m ping
```
